  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.1",
  "name": "microvqa",
  "description": "MicroVQA:  A Multimodal Reasoning Benchmark for Microscopy-Based Scientific Research (CVPR 2025)\n\n\n \n  \n \ud83c\udf10 Homepage / blog \u2022\n \ud83d\udcdd arXiv \u2022\n \ud83e\udd17 HF Dataset \u2022\n\ud83d\udcbb  Code \u2022\n \ud83c\udfdb CC-BY-SA-4.0\n\n\nMicroVQA is expert-curated benchmark for multimodal reasoning for microscopy-based scientific research, proposed in the paper MicroVQA: A Multimodal Reasoning Benchmark for Microscopy-Based Scientific Research.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tPaper abstract\n\t\n\nScientific research demands sophisticated reasoning over multimodal\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/jmhb/microvqa.",
  "alternateName": [
    "jmhb/microvqa",
    "MicroVQA"
  ],
  "creator": {
    "@type": "Person",
    "name": "James Burgess",
    "url": "https://huggingface.co/jmhb"
  },
